# Links the bundled SQLite (built by //bazel/kmp/sqlite) into this klib, so every native binary that
# depends on :utils:sqlite3 carries SQLite statically. SQLDelight's native driver (SQLiter) only binds the
# sqlite3 C API and leaves linking it to the app, and the Kotlin/Native sysroots have no libsqlite3.
#
# No headers: SQLiter already binds the API, so this klib declares nothing in Kotlin. The library itself is
# passed per target by kmp_cinterop (-staticLibrary), and only where the host can build it.
package = com.moneymanager.sqlite3
